StormSPEED ChangeLog
====================

StormSPEED tags are named <CAM base tag>_ss.<NN>, e.g. cam6_4_211_ss.01:
  - <CAM base tag> is the ESCOMP CAM tag the stormspeed branch is synced to.
  - ss.<NN> increases by one for each PR merged into stormspeed and restarts at
    .01 when stormspeed is synced to a newer CAM tag.
Regression baselines are named after the tag and compiler, e.g.
cam6_4_211_ss.02_intel, and each PR is compared against the baselines of the
previous StormSPEED tag (or of the CAM base tag for ss.01).
Newest entries are at the top.  CAM's own history is in doc/ChangeLog.

