Tag name: cam6_4_211_ss.00
Date: Oct 27, 2026
One-line Summary: Starting point for StormSPEED tags (stormspeed at a222d67)

stormspeed branch at a222d67 (Merge pull request #98 from NCAR/senh_pr4_threads),
based on CAM cam6_4_211.  This tag predates this file; it is recorded here as the
reference point for later StormSPEED tags.

E3SM HOMME dycores: CAM_TARGET=theta-l, theta-l_kokkos, preqx in src/dynamics/senh
(externals senh/dycore = E3SM 057df66, libraries/kokkos = E3SM-Project/kokkos 6a19eb9).

CAM changes beyond cam6_4_211 outside the dycore (not on the CAM trunk at this tag):
- Memory reduction for high-resolution initialization (precursor of ESCOMP/CAM
  PR #1643): cam_shmem_mod (MPI-3 node-shared read-only tables) used by phys_prop,
  soil_erod, mo_jlong and tracer_data; tables freed after init (physprop_final,
  photo_final/jlong_final); initial file closed after init; new namelist
  stream_ndep_mapalgo (N-deposition stream mapping).
- ne1024 restart fix (#71): 64-bit history/restart map sizes (cam_grid_support,
  cam_map_utils).
- CLUBB-MF (#73) for high-resolution convection; aircraft_emit latitude weighting
  only for the FV (LR) dycore.
- SENH hooks in physics: SENH treated like FV/FV3/MPAS/SE where needed (cam_budget,
  geopotential, moist mixing ratio in cam/cam7/simple physpkg); physics_dme_adjust
  skipped for SENH (moist mass adjusted in HOMME, #92).
- Portability: no 16-byte reals with NVHPC (physconst NO_R16); Fortran conformance.
- Build/infrastructure: senh and Kokkos support (configure, build-namelist,
  buildlib, buildcpp, config_pes, namelist_defaults_senh.xml); GitHub CI workflows
  and dockerfiles.

Forked externals (vs cam6_4_211):
- ccs_config_cesm1.0.91_nh.02: ne1024/ne1024pg2/ne16pg2/ne16pg3/MIDWEST grids;
  Kokkos SERIAL on derecho; izumi Kokkos/NAG 7.0 settings; Intel C/C++ icc/icpc.
